<title>HONG KONG: Swire Pacific says to increase land bank.</title>
<headline>Swire Pacific says to increase land bank.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swire Pacific Ltd said on Friday it sees the increase of its land bank for new residential developments as a &quot;top priority&quot;.</p>
<p>&quot;Although the company has a number of residential development projects in hand which will keep it busy in the medium term, the acquisition of land for the development of new residential schemes remains a top priority,&quot; chairman Peter Sutch said in a statement accompanying Swire's 1996 results.</p>
<p>&quot;Opportunities to add to the company's development property land bank will be vigorously pursued,&quot; he said.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6441</p>
